    "privacyQ1": "Why do we collect data?",
    "privacyA1": "- To ensure student safety during the trip.\n- To help the guardian track the student's arrival and departure.\n- To facilitate the work of the driver, supervisor, teacher, and field supervisor.",
    "privacyQ2": "What data do we use?",
    "privacyA2": "- Student name and school number.\n- Civil ID and student photo for identity verification.\n- Home photo and bus geographic location.\n- Student attendance log via barcode.\n- Guardian data for communication.\n- Driver, supervisor, and teacher data.",
